+<guide>
+## CRITICAL RULES FOR ORCHESTRATORS
+
+### THE GOLDEN RULE
+**YOU ORCHESTRATE, YOU DO NOT EXECUTE.**
+
+Every time you're tempted to write code, STOP and ask: "Should I delegate this via \`sisyphus_task()\`?"
